WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.298 --> 00:00:06.655
Before you list or hold a token, ask what its issuer has actually done with its powers.

2
00:00:07.731 --> 00:00:13.621
Enter the issuer's address. Here, Bitstamp's USD issuer, an address Bitstamp published.

3
00:00:20.356 --> 00:00:26.886
Freezes, clawbacks, key changes and changes to its powers, each linked to the ledger transaction.

4
00:00:28.143 --> 00:00:33.862
Issuer Watch tells you the moment an issuer changes those rules, so you are not the last to know.

5
00:00:35.265 --> 00:00:42.286
It checks the issuer continuously and emails you when a control changes. Nineteen dollars a month per issuer.

6
00:00:43.545 --> 00:00:50.438
For issuers: show your holders what you cannot do. The badge is free and reads the ledger every time it loads.

7
00:00:56.494 --> 00:01:03.707
Here is the live badge for Ripple's RLUSD issuer, with the HTML and Markdown to paste on your own site.
